#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""terrace-secrets: create, rotate, re-key, deliver and verify Terrace production secrets.

Operator commands work on a private store directory (TERRACE_SECRETS_STORE), never this
public repository. Host commands (install, verify, apply, reencrypt) run as root on a
production host. No secret value is ever printed, logged or passed as a command argument:
values exist in this process's memory, in sops/age/ssh pipes or environment, or briefly
in a private memory-backed scratch directory. See docs/secrets.md.
"""
